      "id": "claim_825be81c790441a2a47d870e10ad3a34",
      "statement": "The WatchlistRepository contract makes three invariants load-bearing: every operation is scoped to the owning user, a missing and a foreign watchlist both raise WatchlistNotFoundError (indistinguishable), and membership position is authoritative for custom sort.",
