    {
      "id": "claim_3e6f2307bc534840b44f55deba919bac",
      "statement": "set_security_order validates that the submitted security_ids list is an exact permutation (length plus set equality) of the current membership before writing anything, raising WatchlistOrderIdentityError (mapped to HTTP 422) and leaving all positions untouched on rejection; on success it rewrites positions to 0..n-1 authoritatively for custom sort.",
