      "id": "claim_6b6ba1adbc1f492cb29e51b2268feafc",
      "statement": "Watchlist reads enrich each security with current_price, daily_price_change, and daily_price_change_percent using one batched window query (_fetch_price_metrics) that keeps the latest two closes per security via row_number over a date-desc partition; percent is None when the prior close is zero, and securities with no price rows are returned un-enriched.",
